<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>self medicate</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">jeniverse</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">self medicate</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1u7UQIhSUYkQsgWRlNHQ0f</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">3 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">self medicate Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Floating through my body, I can't feel a thing</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm going through some shit that I can't explain</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It is easier for me to self medicate</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But my distorted thoughts, they won't go away (go away)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I know I'm not okay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">('Cause I can't deal, can't deal with anything)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh, I just need to self medicate</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I need sedation, no hesitation)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I, I</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I, I</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I want to come and go and smoke away my brain</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'd rather feel nothing than feel ashamed</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Well I'm up, I'm up, I'm up, you can't touch me now</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But when I come undone, I'm gonna hit the ground</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(don't hit the ground)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I know I'm not okay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">('Cause I can't deal, can't deal with anything)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ooh I just need to self medicate</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I know I'm not okay</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh, I just need to self medicate</p></div></body></tt>